A2 in the maturation of [4Fe-4S] proteins (PubMed:30269484). Involved in the maturation of mitochondrial 2Fe-2S proteins in the late stage of the iron-sulfur cluster assembly pathway."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}